 "body": "This PR aims at solving the long debate that took place on the developers mailing list about the location of cores/tools installed through Boards Manager. On windows it **was** `Roaming\\Arduino15`, which breaks Microsoft rules and causes troubles to who actually like own profile to roam between different computers\n\nNew location is `%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Arduino15`\n\nWhen no custom preferences file location is specified (via CLI) and if the IDE finds something in `%APPDATA%\\Arduino15` and no `%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Arduino15` is present, IDE prefs files will be moved. Nothing will happen otherwise.\n\nFixes #2902\n\n/cc @rogerclarkmelbourne\n",
